sentences.text:
In view of the findings on Issue no.1, the petitioner/s are granted the following reliefs: -
1. fair market value @ Rs.16,74,500/- per acre - per acre for the acquired land as per statement u/s 19 of the LA Act;
2. additional amount @ 12% per annum on the fair market value u/s 23 (1A) of the LA Act , from the date of notification u/s 4 of the LA Act till the date of award or dispossession, whichever is earlier ;
3. solatium u/s 23(2) of LA Act @ 30% on the enhanced amount of compensation ;
Sh. Satya Prakash Tyagi (Deceased) ... vs Union Of India Through on 11 May, 2023 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/175666567/
5 4. interest under Section 28 of L.A Act @ 9% per annum for the first year from the date of dispossession and at the rate of 15% per annum on the difference between the enhanced compensation awarded by this court and the compensation awarded by the LAC for the subsequent period till its payment ;
20.

